{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261124/photo/bkn-20261124201314147-1124_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261124211337\"/><p>警員到翠祿樓調查。(陳嘉順攝)</p><p>今晚(24日)7時12分，一名66歲婦人懷疑於柴灣翠樂邨翠祿樓的家中暈倒，由丈夫發現後致電報案。消防接報趕至，發現屋內堆滿雜物，女事主被困走廊動彈不得，隨即搬開雜物拯救她，惟她當時已氣絕身亡。案件暫列「屍體發現」跟進，女事主的死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:24:10.546141+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:13:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T13:37:14.226341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T13:17:18.093881+00:00","content_hash":"f1230b1bb43191e1f4e7b819e3e26a65534e7853a7dc2f56623c790df6405d43","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:24:10.546141+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}